  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Positioned privately back from the road in a highly sought after seaside suburb, this substantial two-level home offers an ideal combination of prime location, generous proportions and clear scope to modernise and add future value.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless daily living, the main floor features a spacious lounge, open plan kitchen and dining area and a large master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and adjoining bathroom. The lower level welcomes you with a secure entry, two additional bedrooms and a second bathroom perfect for family, guests or a dedicated home office.\r\n\r\nComplete with a lift connecting both floors and a large double garage with workshop space, this home provides long-term practicality in a superb coastal area.\r\n\r\nKey Features: \r\nLocation: short walk to Kohimarama Beach, local cafes and zoned for Kohimarama Primary School & Selwyn College \r\nAccessibility: lift providing effortless access between levels \r\nSpace & Layout: open-plan living areas \r\nGaraging: with internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking and workshop space \r\nBathrooms: two full bathrooms (one on each level) \r\nOpportunity: there is genuine scope to update and add value",
